{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>ובער</b> — Twice in the Masorah: here and the other: ובער עליה הכהן. Even though we expound it of tooth and foot that trampled the produce and damaged it, the same applies to all kinds of damage: if wood was stored there and it destroyed it, he is liable for them."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:59.235884937Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}